  "description": "The M8 tuned baseline, and the first corpus case to exercise the `place` command. Recorded after the balance pass that moved the median match from 1.6 minutes to 6.2 (base hp 1500->10500, build times up ~70%, ore/node 1500->3400, and a sharper CR-001 ramp). It carries player commands AND the AI's, so the hashes cover both command sources interleaving under O-4. The placement at tick 900 closes M7-F5: `place` was added in M6 and hashed with an exhaustiveness guard, but until now no recorded case replayed one, so its encoding was asserted by unit test and never across platforms.",
